# NBG51: checked against the text on bible.com, Sept 2026.
use exo-5-24
use 1sa-20-43
use job-38-41
use hos-1-12
use hag-2-24
use rom-7-26
use jhn-1-52

# Nehemiah 7 has the Hebrew's 72 verses (no horses and mules), so it isn't
# neh-8-19's English chapter 7; 8:1 is "and when the seventh month came",
# the end of Hebrew 7:72. Chapter 7 is listed so that it and 8:1 map onto
# Hebrew 7:72 under one system.
NEH 7:1-72 = NEH 7:1-72
NEH 8:1 = NEH 7:72
NEH 8:2-19 = NEH 8:1-18
